// What an array literal answers when something asks for its type without
// offering one. Every place a literal can legally be written supplies the
// wanted type instead (check/store/more/arr.id), so this is a fallback for
// diagnostics rather than the rule: a literal's type is its context's.

type_arr(int id) {
